### Criar produto (guarda o id em productId para os pedidos seguintes)
POST http://localhost:8081/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "75% layout, hot-swappable switches",
  "price": 129.90,
  "stock": 25
}

> {% client.global.set("productId", response.body.id); %}

### Listar todos
GET http://localhost:8081/products

### Obter por id
GET http://localhost:8081/products/{{productId}}

### Atualizar (PUT substitui o produto inteiro)
PUT http://localhost:8081/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "75% layout, hot-swappable switches",
  "price": 99.90,
  "stock": 10
}

### Validação: nome vazio e preço negativo -> 400
POST http://localhost:8081/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -5,
  "stock": 1
}

### Id que não existe -> 404 (ProblemDetail)
GET http://localhost:8081/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Apagar -> 204
DELETE http://localhost:8081/products/{{productId}}

### Depois de apagar -> 404
GET http://localhost:8081/products/{{productId}}

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health
